# Cloudflare Pages headers for phantomburn.net (a private preview): nothing
# is to be indexed, anywhere. The game needs no cross-origin isolation (no
# SharedArrayBuffer, no audio worklet), so there is no COOP/COEP.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
